# 11. Privacy and retention

Recommended separate retention:

```text
original audio: short retention, e.g. 7–30 days unless needed for a dispute
raw transcript: according to privacy policy and customer deletion rights
confirmed transcript: retain only when needed for order/audit/support
normalized preference: retain only with a legitimate purpose and provenance
```

When the customer requests deletion:

- delete original audio;
- delete raw transcript where policy allows;
- remove address and unnecessary personal data;
- retain only legally/operationally required order records;
- preserve opt-out suppression state;
- record the deletion event without preserving the deleted content.

Never use voice recordings for model training or staff review without an approved purpose and notice.

