# 14. Launch roadmap

## P0 — safe text-confirmed voice ordering

1. Accept WhatsApp audio webhooks.
2. Acknowledge immediately.
3. Download media asynchronously.
4. Use the current OpenAI transcription path as the baseline.
5. Store raw and normalized transcript separately.
6. Show transcript confirmation.
7. Parse only after confirmation.
8. Require normal basket and order confirmation.
9. Add voice retries and duplicate protection.
10. Add Arabic, English, and mixed-language tests.

## P1 — Lebanese quality

1. Build the real Lebanese voice evaluation set.
2. Benchmark OpenAI, Deepgram, and one additional provider.
3. Add Arabizi and code-switching normalizer.
4. Add menu aliases and restaurant-name vocabulary.
5. Add confidence and ambiguity policy.
6. Add address and landmark extraction.
7. Add provider fallback for critical low-confidence cases.
8. Add voice cost and latency dashboards.

## P2 — advanced experience

1. Voice-note reorder.
2. Voice-based address updates with confirmation.
3. Voice-based substitutions with confirmation.
4. Merchant voice operations with apply/edit/cancel confirmation.
5. Personal preference extraction from confirmed voice orders.
6. Voice support and complaint routing.
7. Optional voice replies only if customers request them.

